<!--
woo:program (nms:program 확장 · AI Studio 폴더 플래그)
======================================================
Program 폴더 Properties 편집 컨텍스트는 nms:program.
xtk:folder 만 확장하면 XML-110013: Attribute 'isAiFolder' unknown (nms:program).

[Main Functions]
===========
- nms:program 폼/문서에 @isAiFolder 노출
- 물리 컬럼은 folder 확장과 동일 sqlname 공유 (XtkFolder)

[Attributes]
=========
- isAiFolder (boolean) sqlname=iIsAiFolder

[Dependencies]
=========
- new_ver/schema/testWooFolderExt.xml (listAiFolders용 xtk:folder)
- Update database structure (컬럼 이미 있으면 스키마만 재생성)
-->
<srcSchema _cs="Program AI extend (woo)" extendedSchema="nms:program"
           entitySchema="xtk:srcSchema" img="xtk:schema.png"
           label="Program (Test Woo AI)" mappingType="sql" name="program"
           namespace="woo" xtkschema="xtk:srcSchema">

  <element name="program">
    <attribute default="false" desc="AI Studio campaign folder flag (UI-3-2)"
               label="AI Studio folder" name="isAiFolder" sqlname="iIsAiFolder"
               type="boolean" user="true"/>
  </element>

</srcSchema>
